(7329993, 1144476, 30490, '<td valign="top">Apple? What about an apple?  <br/> <br/>This is a great snake image, and I can''t believe I have had it on my screen long enough to vote, title and comment.... I HATE snakes! Shiver!!! Nice focus and the eye is quite compelling.  I like the brokeh too.</td>', 'Apple? What about an apple?   This is a great snake image, and I can''t believe I have had it on my screen long enough to vote, title and comment.... I HATE snakes! Shiver!!! Nice focus and the eye is quite compelling.  I like the brokeh too.', '2015-03-19 02:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7329994, 1144487, 30490, '<td valign="top">Clarence didn''t understand why the TV remote wouldn''t work until he realized that the baby had swapped the toilet and the TV remotes.<br/> <br/>(I know it is a long title, but I had fun with it!)<br/> <br/>Great image that reminds the viewer of how much technology there is in our houses today.  I have never seen a remote for a toilet, but I know they exist.  Clear image too.</td>', 'Clarence didn''t understand why the TV remote wouldn''t work until he realized that the baby had swapped the toilet and the TV remotes. (I know it is a long title, but I had fun with it!) Great image that reminds the viewer of how much technology there is in our houses today.  I have never seen a remote for a toilet, but I know they exist.  Clear image too.', '2015-03-19 02:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
