(7330433, 1144399, 10785, '<td valign="top">Suggested Name: Go Team!<br/> <br/>Comment: Nice sport shot. A tough exposure with the white uniforms and black warm ups. It looks like you lost some details in the bright and the dark ends. Color is great and some nice emotion captured.</td>', 'Suggested Name: Go Team! Comment: Nice sport shot. A tough exposure with the white uniforms and black warm ups. It looks like you lost some details in the bright and the dark ends. Color is great and some nice emotion captured.', '2015-03-19 15:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330434, 1144441, 10785, '<td valign="top">Suggested Name: Ghost Park Road<br/> <br/>Comments: Blur and focus add depth and mystery to an otherwise ordinary viewpoint. Like the mix of highlights and shadows to create mood. Could use a moving person to add greater interest.</td>', 'Suggested Name: Ghost Park Road Comments: Blur and focus add depth and mystery to an otherwise ordinary viewpoint. Like the mix of highlights and shadows to create mood. Could use a moving person to add greater interest.', '2015-03-19 15:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7330435, 1144493, 10785, '<td valign="top">Suggested Name: Lonely Betty<br/> <br/>Comments: Great color and a wonderful location for lighting and scenery. I like how the sharpness in the middle of the shot is used to focus on the subject. The hanging branches at the top frame the subject. However with such a wide angle you captured the swing set and another building or structure on the left and right sides in the background, which takes away from the ambiance of the scene. I would suggest going closer to create intimacy.</td>', 'Suggested Name: Lonely Betty Comments: Great color and a wonderful location for lighting and scenery. I like how the sharpness in the middle of the shot is used to focus on the subject. The hanging branches at the top frame the subject. However with such a wide angle you captured the swing set and another building or structure on the left and right sides in the background, which takes away from the ambiance of the scene. I would suggest going closer to create intimacy.', '2015-03-19 15:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
