(7331164, 1144470, 30490, '<td valign="top">Family time<br/> <br/>This would be a better image if it was more in focus.  I''m not sure if the blurry effect was your intent, but it doesn''t work well for me.  Otherwise the image captures a fun family time with the center of attention being one fine looking cat.  I like the smiles on the kid''s faces and it gives off the sense of a warm and loving family moment.  Perfect thing to capture and keep for fond recollections.</td>', 'Family time This would be a better image if it was more in focus.  I''m not sure if the blurry effect was your intent, but it doesn''t work well for me.  Otherwise the image captures a fun family time with the center of attention being one fine looking cat.  I like the smiles on the kid''s faces and it gives off the sense of a warm and loving family moment.  Perfect thing to capture and keep for fond recollections.', '2015-03-20 14:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
