(7331622, 1144513, 173844, '<td valign="top">Dastardly Criminal Or Guy Riding His Bike?<br/> <br/>Only your mindset knows for sure.  The blur and darkness invite a murky inner search for meaning.  The bright scene in the mid-ground store wonderfully distracts the eye.  Strong, effective and captivating.  Cropping out the bright object on the far right might dispel with, what for me, is a distraction (not a wonderful one).</td>', 'Dastardly Criminal Or Guy Riding His Bike? Only your mindset knows for sure.  The blur and darkness invite a murky inner search for meaning.  The bright scene in the mid-ground store wonderfully distracts the eye.  Strong, effective and captivating.  Cropping out the bright object on the far right might dispel with, what for me, is a distraction (not a wonderful one).', '2015-03-21 12:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
