(7331822, 1144538, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love this excellent street photography capture from the woman glancing at something of interest off camera, to the laundromat/washeteria (which is becoming a rare thing) and fantastic B&amp;W tones. That said, off to some suggestions:<br/> <br/>My suggestions: Wednesday''s Wash or Out to Dry<br/> <br/>My Husband''s suggestion: Permanent Press</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love this excellent street photography capture from the woman glancing at something of interest off camera, to the laundromat/washeteria (which is becoming a rare thing) and fantastic B&W tones. That said, off to some suggestions: My suggestions: Wednesday''s Wash or Out to Dry My Husband''s suggestion: Permanent Press', '2015-03-21 15:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
