(7333941, 1144397, 173844, '<td valign="top">Homer''s Childhood<br/> <br/>Beautiful light, color and detail. Active and peaceful.  My personal favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'Homer''s Childhood Beautiful light, color and detail. Active and peaceful.  My personal favorite in the challenge.', '2015-03-24 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333942, 1144492, 173844, '<td valign="top">Tangled<br/> <br/>You never know, but to me she looks sad and isolated.  I hope someone is there for her.  The sensitive treatment of the "subject" and the excellent depth of field make this a very fine photograph.  My second favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'Tangled You never know, but to me she looks sad and isolated.  I hope someone is there for her.  The sensitive treatment of the "subject" and the excellent depth of field make this a very fine photograph.  My second favorite in the challenge.', '2015-03-24 20:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333943, 1144352, 173844, '<td valign="top">Gleam Dream Time<br/> <br/>Lovely, wistful portrait.  She''s like a Hershey''s kiss.  Looks like a lot of chrominance noise, if I''m interpreting this properly.</td>', 'Gleam Dream Time Lovely, wistful portrait.  She''s like a Hershey''s kiss.  Looks like a lot of chrominance noise, if I''m interpreting this properly.', '2015-03-24 20:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333944, 1144322, 173844, '<td valign="top">Catching Fire<br/> <br/>Very pretty scene.  I like the diagonal fishing rod and the fisherman tucked into nighttime''s corner.  The noise in the lower half of the image is not bothersome.</td>', 'Catching Fire Very pretty scene.  I like the diagonal fishing rod and the fisherman tucked into nighttime''s corner.  The noise in the lower half of the image is not bothersome.', '2015-03-24 20:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333945, 1144418, 173844, '<td valign="top">Who Took My Fingers?<br/> <br/>Great realistic image that''ll probably inspire a lot of terrific titles.  The greenish overall tone works perfectly to bring out a civilization in decline atmosphere.  The nonchalant siting of the dinosaur adds to the fun.</td>', 'Who Took My Fingers? Great realistic image that''ll probably inspire a lot of terrific titles.  The greenish overall tone works perfectly to bring out a civilization in decline atmosphere.  The nonchalant siting of the dinosaur adds to the fun.', '2015-03-24 20:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333946, 1144538, 173844, '<td valign="top">Strange Journey of the Golden Fleece<br/> <br/>Lot of room for interpretation here.  And actually it''s a fine, intriguing image.  She''s the star, of course, but the wealth of detail situates her in a peculiar local world.</td>', 'Strange Journey of the Golden Fleece Lot of room for interpretation here.  And actually it''s a fine, intriguing image.  She''s the star, of course, but the wealth of detail situates her in a peculiar local world.', '2015-03-24 20:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333947, 1144611, 173844, '<td valign="top">"Brahms, Early Beatles and Firetruck Sirens.  Why Do You Ask"<br/> <br/>Looks kind of menacing, but I''ll bet she''s/he''s a sweetie.  The reflections transform the photo into something atmospheric and mysterious, but only in furtherance of a finely posed dog in a car and with a glint in his eye.  Nice.</td>', '"Brahms, Early Beatles and Firetruck Sirens.  Why Do You Ask" Looks kind of menacing, but I''ll bet she''s/he''s a sweetie.  The reflections transform the photo into something atmospheric and mysterious, but only in furtherance of a finely posed dog in a car and with a glint in his eye.  Nice.', '2015-03-24 20:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333948, 1144433, 173844, '<td valign="top">Civilization Advances<br/> <br/>Strange little tongue of a bay.  Can''t decide if the yellow cast to the atmosphere is intriguing or deleterious.  Shadows dominate the image... see prior comment.</td>', 'Civilization Advances Strange little tongue of a bay.  Can''t decide if the yellow cast to the atmosphere is intriguing or deleterious.  Shadows dominate the image... see prior comment.', '2015-03-24 20:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333949, 1144599, 173844, '<td valign="top">"But The Food''s This Way"<br/> <br/>Aside from the sky, nice harmony of colors.</td>', '"But The Food''s This Way" Aside from the sky, nice harmony of colors.', '2015-03-24 20:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333950, 1144447, 173844, '<td valign="top">Her Phone Number<br/> <br/>Nicely caught casual moment, emphasized by all the rigid lines surrounding him.  Personally, I''d rather see his feet than not.</td>', 'Her Phone Number Nicely caught casual moment, emphasized by all the rigid lines surrounding him.  Personally, I''d rather see his feet than not.', '2015-03-24 20:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333951, 1144455, 173844, '<td valign="top">Cherry Spritzer<br/> <br/>Don''t know it they''re actually cherry flowers, but poetic license...  Very nice swirling bokeh.</td>', 'Cherry Spritzer Don''t know it they''re actually cherry flowers, but poetic license...  Very nice swirling bokeh.', '2015-03-24 20:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333952, 1144250, 173844, '<td valign="top">"Psst, There''s An Alien Spacecraft Overhead"<br/> <br/>Looks like the very beginning of a science fiction movie.</td>', '"Psst, There''s An Alien Spacecraft Overhead" Looks like the very beginning of a science fiction movie.', '2015-03-24 20:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333953, 1144441, 173844, '<td valign="top">Rainy Day Cribbage<br/> <br/>Usually I like this kind of image, but there''s too much work for me here.  Still, rated it high on principle.</td>', 'Rainy Day Cribbage Usually I like this kind of image, but there''s too much work for me here.  Still, rated it high on principle.', '2015-03-24 20:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
