(7333957, 1144556, 173844, '<td valign="top">"If I Had Wanted Your Advise I Would Have Asked For It"<br/> <br/>Funny.  Sure to elicit many good titles.</td>', '"If I Had Wanted Your Advise I Would Have Asked For It" Funny.  Sure to elicit many good titles.', '2015-03-24 20:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333958, 1144476, 173844, '<td valign="top">"....But I Have a Warm Heart"<br/> <br/>Cute.  (When I was in sixth grade I wanted to be a herpetologist).</td>', '"....But I Have a Warm Heart" Cute.  (When I was in sixth grade I wanted to be a herpetologist).', '2015-03-24 20:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333959, 1144609, 173844, '<td valign="top">Kaleidonude<br/> <br/>Fascinating.  The skin color overlaps, the movement and her naked body offer great possibilities, but here I personally don''t find the chosen poses to be interesting.  I''d love to see more of this.</td>', 'Kaleidonude Fascinating.  The skin color overlaps, the movement and her naked body offer great possibilities, but here I personally don''t find the chosen poses to be interesting.  I''d love to see more of this.', '2015-03-24 20:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333960, 1144411, 173844, '<td valign="top">"Excuse Me.  The Laxatives Are Kicking In."<br/> <br/>Fun, retro, blast from the past image.  The woman on the left, with her hand to her ear --  her forehead area could use some burning.</td>', '"Excuse Me.  The Laxatives Are Kicking In." Fun, retro, blast from the past image.  The woman on the left, with her hand to her ear --  her forehead area could use some burning.', '2015-03-24 20:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333961, 1144585, 173844, '<td valign="top">Picasso''s Wet Dream<br/> <br/>Beautiful, intriguing water reflection.</td>', 'Picasso''s Wet Dream Beautiful, intriguing water reflection.', '2015-03-24 20:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333962, 1144034, 173844, '<td valign="top">Art Before Laundry<br/> <br/>You''d think they''re just there for reflection, but mirrors change everything.  Whether bringing in the sky, catching the unaware or merely multiplying the obvious, it''s often the ace up the sleeve.  Here the photographer neatly gives the lie to this seemingly dingy room via the mirror''s glimpse of freedom.<br/>Or maybe I''m just being a blowhard.</td>', 'Art Before Laundry You''d think they''re just there for reflection, but mirrors change everything.  Whether bringing in the sky, catching the unaware or merely multiplying the obvious, it''s often the ace up the sleeve.  Here the photographer neatly gives the lie to this seemingly dingy room via the mirror''s glimpse of freedom.Or maybe I''m just being a blowhard.', '2015-03-24 20:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333963, 1144391, 173844, '<td valign="top">So Much Glee<br/> <br/>Very sweet portrait.  I like that the shallow depth of field concentrates on the hands --  we already know he''s adorable.</td>', 'So Much Glee Very sweet portrait.  I like that the shallow depth of field concentrates on the hands --  we already know he''s adorable.', '2015-03-24 20:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333964, 1144459, 173844, '<td valign="top">Ready For Winter<br/> <br/>Curious look.  It seems packed with symbolism, but I''m not fathoming it.  Looks like something from Ingmar Bergman.</td>', 'Ready For Winter Curious look.  It seems packed with symbolism, but I''m not fathoming it.  Looks like something from Ingmar Bergman.', '2015-03-24 20:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333965, 1144334, 173844, '<td valign="top">"You Get the Soda, I Have the Jumbo Popcorn." <br/> <br/>Intriguing perspective.</td>', '"You Get the Soda, I Have the Jumbo Popcorn."  Intriguing perspective.', '2015-03-24 20:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333966, 1144601, 173844, '<td valign="top">I Still Don''t Know Him<br/> <br/>The two figures are certainly interesting, but excess clutter intrudes on them.  Maybe that''s intentional, and if so, pardon the critical comment.</td>', 'I Still Don''t Know Him The two figures are certainly interesting, but excess clutter intrudes on them.  Maybe that''s intentional, and if so, pardon the critical comment.', '2015-03-24 20:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333967, 1144178, 173844, '<td valign="top">"I''m on the Outside, Looking In..."<br/> <br/>The ice''s surface makes subtle and ambiguous transitions to look like water and sky.  Very engaging.</td>', '"I''m on the Outside, Looking In..." The ice''s surface makes subtle and ambiguous transitions to look like water and sky.  Very engaging.', '2015-03-24 20:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333968, 1144493, 173844, '<td valign="top">I Made of You Music<br/> <br/>The woman''s pose and the shape of the tree she''s leaning on pleasingly complement each other.  The way her right hand is flatly placed on the guitar seems over-posed, but I understand how it avoids motion blur.  Also, I''m not sure of the vignette.</td>', 'I Made of You Music The woman''s pose and the shape of the tree she''s leaning on pleasingly complement each other.  The way her right hand is flatly placed on the guitar seems over-posed, but I understand how it avoids motion blur.  Also, I''m not sure of the vignette.', '2015-03-24 20:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333969, 1144607, 173844, '<td valign="top">Mackerel Shallows<br/> <br/>Looks like a quixotic amalgam of sky and water, with some stuff on the bottom, but I don''t believe I''m understanding this image.</td>', 'Mackerel Shallows Looks like a quixotic amalgam of sky and water, with some stuff on the bottom, but I don''t believe I''m understanding this image.', '2015-03-24 20:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333970, 1144569, 173844, '<td valign="top">Flecks Make Mountains<br/> <br/>The intensive processing detail moves this landscape into a wild direction, like maybe a pen and ink study.  If I were hiking through here I''d be rather nervous.</td>', 'Flecks Make Mountains The intensive processing detail moves this landscape into a wild direction, like maybe a pen and ink study.  If I were hiking through here I''d be rather nervous.', '2015-03-24 20:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7333971, 1144131, 173844, '<td valign="top">Don''t Mess With The Yankees<br/> <br/>Actually it looks like a scuff made by playing on a concrete field.  Way to evoke memories.</td>', 'Don''t Mess With The Yankees Actually it looks like a scuff made by playing on a concrete field.  Way to evoke memories.', '2015-03-24 20:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
