(7334037, 1144524, 177322, '<td valign="top">Dayspring''s Splendor<br/> <br/>If this is a sunset, I''m prepared to be embarrassed by the title I''m offering.  This is a spectacular image of the Golden Gate Bridge from such a unique perspective and if I''ve missed the clock by a few hours, so be it. Stunning clarity and colors. Some may find the bulk of the headlands oppressive in the frame, but, for me, it is an anchor.  A solid ten from me.</td>', 'Dayspring''s Splendor If this is a sunset, I''m prepared to be embarrassed by the title I''m offering.  This is a spectacular image of the Golden Gate Bridge from such a unique perspective and if I''ve missed the clock by a few hours, so be it. Stunning clarity and colors. Some may find the bulk of the headlands oppressive in the frame, but, for me, it is an anchor.  A solid ten from me.', '2015-03-24 22:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7334038, 1144317, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m Seeing Green</td>', 'I''m Seeing Green', '2015-03-24 22:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7334039, 1144447, 177322, '<td valign="top">Dear John,<br/> <br/> <br/>Wish that fellow on the right wasn''t there, but you had no control over that and if you had waited for him to pass you would have missed the expression on the man''s face.  Good photojournalism.  <strike>Seven</strike> Nine from me after I kept coming back to this image.  Good luck!</td>', 'Dear John,  Wish that fellow on the right wasn''t there, but you had no control over that and if you had waited for him to pass you would have missed the expression on the man''s face.  Good photojournalism.  Seven Nine from me after I kept coming back to this image.  Good luck!', '2015-03-24 22:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7334040, 1144521, 177322, '<td valign="top">"...Time, the subtle thief of youth..."<br/> <br/>Sonnet VII: How soon hath Time, the Subtle Thief of Youth<br/>John Milton<br/> <br/>Hopeful innocence radiates from the cherub-like expression of the lass, yet behind her is the clock ticking -always ticking.  Almost haunting - an indelible image flawlessly crafted.  <br/> <br/>Eight from me.</td>', '"...Time, the subtle thief of youth..." Sonnet VII: How soon hath Time, the Subtle Thief of YouthJohn Milton Hopeful innocence radiates from the cherub-like expression of the lass, yet behind her is the clock ticking -always ticking.  Almost haunting - an indelible image flawlessly crafted.   Eight from me.', '2015-03-24 22:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
